From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenFuse contributors <openfuse@invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:04:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] ALSA: usb-audio: Hook up Arturia MiniFuse mixer quirk

The Arturia MiniFuse interfaces control their front-panel switches
(INST, 48V, DIRECT MONO), the loopback mixer and the level meters with
vendor-defined class requests on the audio control interface, which
snd-usb-audio owns, so userspace cannot send them without detaching
the driver.

Call the MiniFuse mixer quirk for the MiniFuse 2 (1c75:af90) and build
it as part of snd-usb-audio. The quirk itself lives in
mixer_minifuse.c / mixer_minifuse.h.

Signed-off-by: OpenFuse contributors <openfuse@invalid>
---
 sound/usb/Makefile       | 1 +
 sound/usb/mixer_quirks.c | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/usb/Makefile b/sound/usb/Makefile
index e62794a..08b037b 100644
--- a/sound/usb/Makefile
+++ b/sound/usb/Makefile
@@ -12,6 +12,7 @@ snd-usb-audio-y := 	card.o \
 			implicit.o \
 			mixer.o \
 			mixer_quirks.o \
+			mixer_minifuse.o \
 			mixer_scarlett.o \
 			mixer_scarlett2.o \
 			mixer_us16x08.o \
diff --git a/sound/usb/mixer_quirks.c b/sound/usb/mixer_quirks.c
index fc622eb..d90ec7d 100644
--- a/sound/usb/mixer_quirks.c
+++ b/sound/usb/mixer_quirks.c
@@ -34,6 +34,7 @@
 #include "usbaudio.h"
 #include "mixer.h"
 #include "mixer_quirks.h"
+#include "mixer_minifuse.h"
 #include "mixer_scarlett.h"
 #include "mixer_scarlett2.h"
 #include "mixer_us16x08.h"
@@ -4604,6 +4605,9 @@ int snd_usb_mixer_apply_create_quirk(struct usb_mixer_interface *mixer)
 	case USB_ID(0x03f0, 0x0269): /* HP TB Dock G2 */
 		err = hp_dock_mixer_create(mixer);
 		break;
+	case USB_ID(0x1c75, 0xaf90): /* Arturia MiniFuse 2 */
+		err = snd_minifuse_init(mixer);
+		break;
 	}
 
 	return err;
